      "p0001-n0002-l0004"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "With the development of technology and the explosive growth of data, data is becoming an important strategic asset in today's society, and it is more and more important to establish a suitable system to manage and analyze the data. In this paper, we build a model to analyze the factors affecting the maturity of data analysis systems, revealing how to make better use of data, and for- mulate plans to maximize the potential of data assets."
  },
  {
