    ],
    "text": "In Task3: In order to formulate an agreement to measure the effectiveness of the system, we divide different index levels from the perspectives of people, technology and process, using the Apriori to analyze the rule association between the three groups of indicators, combined with system dynamics simulation in the way of simulation, we give the relevant agreement of the ICM data analysis system in the connection mechanism between people, technology, process and the three together."
  },
