    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "In Task4: First, we evaluate the model based on the differences in data analysis systems of seaport companies with different scales, and conduct multiple sets of simulations based on the model proposed in task 2 simulation. Then, we compare the errors between the simulated maturity index and the results obtained by the DAMM model, which are all smaller than 5%, showing the good applicability of the model to seaport companies of different sizes. Finally, combined with the International Standard Plan of \"Quality Management System Requirements\" (ISO9001), we ana- lyze the reasons for the universality of DAMM, and give three benefits for customers to adopt DAMM for ICM."
  },
